<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Chandrasuriya</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Sanda Thuriya</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Chandrasuriya is a king of Dhanyawadi in Arakan, western Myanmar, known from Arakanese tradition. The chronicles say that the Buddha visited his kingdom and that the Mahamuni image was cast in the Buddha's likeness during his reign, an account that is legendary rather than historical.</p></div>
